<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy | Materuni Hosts Booking Information" description="Read how Materuni Hosts uses and protects information submitted through booking requests, availability forms and website guest conversations.">
<section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</span><h1>Privacy, handled with care.</h1><p>We use the information you share to arrange your Materuni experience and respond to your questions.</p></section>
<section class="section legal-copy">
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you send a booking request, we may collect your name, email address, phone number, nationality or country of residence, preferred contact method, pickup point, travel date, group size and any notes you choose to provide.</p>
  <p>If you use the website concierge, we store the messages in that conversation, the selected language and a randomly generated session identifier. A one-way hashed network identifier may be used to limit automated abuse; we do not store the raw IP address in the concierge rate-limit record.</p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul><li>To receive and manage booking requests and availability.</li><li>To contact you about your requested experience and practical arrangements.</li><li>To answer questions through the website concierge or WhatsApp.</li><li>To maintain delivery logs for booking notifications and prevent repeated automated requests.</li></ul>
  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>Our website and booking records are hosted using Supabase. If AI-generated concierge replies are enabled, conversation messages are sent to the configured AI provider to generate a response. If email or automatic WhatsApp notifications are enabled, the relevant booking details are sent to the configured email or WhatsApp service provider. These integrations are only used for the purposes described here.</p>
  <h2>Payments and sensitive information</h2>
  <p>The website does not currently collect card payments. Do not send payment card details, passwords or passport copies through the website concierge or booking notes. Payment instructions are shared only after a host has reviewed and confirmed the arrangements.</p>
  <h2>Sharing, international transfers and retention</h2>
  <p>We do not sell personal information. We share only the details needed with service providers that support booking, hosting, messaging, analytics (only if you opt in) and customer support. These providers may process information in countries other than the country where you are located. We use the providers configured for this website and limit the information sent to what is needed for the relevant service.</p>
  <p>We retain enquiry, booking, concierge and notification records only for as long as reasonably needed for the purpose collected, to resolve disputes, maintain business records and meet applicable legal obligations. Exact retention periods depend on the record type and legal requirements; contact us to ask about a specific record.</p>
  <h2>Your privacy rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live and which law applies, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, deletion of or a copy of your personal information, to object to or restrict certain processing, and to withdraw consent where processing relies on consent. We will verify requests and respond subject to applicable law and lawful record-retention requirements. Contact <a href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com">hello@materunihosts.com</a> and include your booking reference if you have one.</p>
  <h2>Cookies, analytics and local storage</h2>
  <p>Essential browser storage supports website functions such as remembering your cookie choice and the concierge session. Optional analytics are not loaded unless you choose to allow them through the cookie notice. You can reject optional analytics, or reopen Privacy settings using the persistent Privacy settings control at the bottom of the website to change or withdraw your choice. We do not intentionally load advertising trackers through this consent choice.</p>
  <h2>Controller and contact</h2>
  <p>For website privacy questions and requests, contact Materuni Hosts at <a href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com">hello@materunihosts.com</a>. Please do not include passwords, payment-card data or unnecessary sensitive information in your request.</p>
  <h2>Policy scope</h2>
  <p>This notice describes the website and booking enquiry practices currently in use. It is not a statement that Materuni Hosts has been certified or independently audited for GDPR, UK GDPR, CCPA/CPRA or any other privacy framework. The laws that apply depend on the circumstances of the visitor and the business; seek qualified legal advice for a formal compliance assessment.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions, contact Materuni Hosts at <a href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com">hello@materunihosts.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/255612068540">+255 612 068 540</a>.</p>
  <p class="muted legal-updated">Last updated: 11 October 2026.</p>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
